    "preamble": "Ansari vs Karunapuram Grama Panchayat on 1 July, 2022 Author: N.Nagaresh Bench: N.Nagaresh In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Nagaresh Friday, The 1St Day Of July 2022 / 10Th Ashadha, 1944 Wp(C) No. 21034 Of 2022 Petitioner: Ansari Aged 36 Years S/O. Shahul Hameed, Residing At Block No.342, Thookkupalam, Kollar. P.O., Idukki 685 552. By Advs. M.Narendra Kumar Harshadev M. Respondents: Karunapuram Grama Panchayat, Represented By Its Secretary, Office Of The Grama Panchayat, Koottar P.O., Idukki District, Pin-685552. Smt.V.H.Jasmine(Sc)",
    "facts": "The petitioner approached this Court aggrieved by denial of renewal of licence for conducting meat stall. 2. When the writ petition came up for hearing today, the Standing Counsel representing the Grama Panchayat submitted that the application submitted by the petitioner for renewal of licence has been considered and renewal is granted in favour of the petitioner.",
